---
import Reveal from "./Reveal.astro";
---

<Reveal id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="min-w-0 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="section-kicker bg-yellow">Profile / 01</p>
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-black uppercase leading-[0.95] sm:text-6xl">
          Practical engineering, backed by real delivery.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
          I am a final-year Computer Science student specializing in Intelligent
          Computing and a backend-focused software engineer with enterprise experience
          at B. Braun. I design FastAPI services and RESTful APIs, integrate AI
          capabilities into scalable backend systems, and ship full-stack products with
          a focus on reliability, security, and maintainable architecture.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <article class="brutal-panel min-w-0 bg-blue p-6 text-white">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">How I work</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-black">Collaborative engineering</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Clarifying requirements, documenting APIs, and coordinating delivery across teams.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="brutal-panel min-w-0 bg-coral p-6">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">What I value</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-black">Production thinking</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Reliable APIs, secure integrations, maintainable architecture, and complete delivery.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="grid min-w-0 content-start gap-5 lg:col-span-5" aria-label="Profile highlights">
        <div class="brutal-card min-w-0 bg-yellow p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-6xl font-black leading-none sm:text-7xl">3.75</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">CGPA / 4.00</p>
        </div>
        <div class="brutal-card min-w-0 bg-white p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-6xl font-black leading-none sm:text-7xl">20+</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">REST APIs shipped</p>
        </div>
        <div class="brutal-card min-w-0 bg-coral p-7 sm:p-8">
          <p class="font-display text-6xl font-black leading-none sm:text-7xl">67%</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">Fewer vulnerabilities</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-ink bg-ink p-6 text-white">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-yellow">Current focus</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug">
            Backend engineering, applied AI, cloud integrations, and end-to-end products.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Reveal>
